! ===========================================================================
! streaming-telemetry.blocklist
! Device-agnostic: streaming app and smart-TV telemetry that is not tied to
! one vendor. Measured against live traffic from a smart TV and a set of
! streaming apps.
!
! Format: Adblock-Plus style, one rule per line.
!   ||domain^      block the domain and every subdomain
!   @@||domain^    never block (KEEP) - these win over block rules
!   /^regex$/      block when the regular expression matches
!
! DESIGN RULE: telemetry only. Playback, DRM licensing, image and video CDNs
! stay allowed. Over-blocking here breaks streaming, so start with this file
! and add to it from your own query log.
! ===========================================================================

! --- Netflix device telemetry and viewing events ---
||nrdp.prod.cloud.netflix.com^
||nrdp.prod.ftl.netflix.com^
||nrdp51-appboot.netflix.com^
||nrdp-cell4.prod.ftl.netflix.com^
||nrdp.logs.netflix.com^
||logs.netflix.com^
||ichnaea.netflix.com^
||customerevents.netflix.com^

! --- Amazon device telemetry ---
||unagi-na.amazon.com^
||unagi.amazon.com^
||minerva.devices.a2z.com^
||telemetry.insights.video.a2z.com^

! --- Crash and error reporting ---
||ingest.sentry.io^
||insights-collector.newrelic.com^

! --- Smart home / device cloud ---
||client.smartthings.com^

! --- KEEP: playback and licensing must survive filtering ---
@@||api-global.netflix.com^
@@||secure.netflix.com^
@@||uiboot.netflix.com^
@@||cdn-0.nflximg.com^
